<view class="screen">
  <view class="hero surface">
    <text class="hero-kicker">巧囊闭经针治疗期</text>
    <text class="hero-title">把骨健康放在减脂前面</text>
    <text class="hero-copy">食谱只能帮助日常执行，钙和维生素 D 的治疗剂量、疗程监测及 add-back 治疗以开药医生为准。</text>
  </view>

  <text class="section-title">每天的两个锚点</text>
  <view class="anchor-grid">
    <view class="anchor surface"><text class="anchor-number">01</text><text class="anchor-title">奶或强化豆奶</text><text class="anchor-copy">约 300 ml，豆奶看标签确认强化钙含量。</text></view>
    <view class="anchor surface"><text class="anchor-number">02</text><text class="anchor-title">酸奶 / 豆腐 / 小鱼</text><text class="anchor-copy">再选一个食物来源，深绿叶菜是加分项。</text></view>
  </view>

  <text class="section-title">计划提醒</text>
  <view class="surface setting-list">
    <view class="setting-row"><view><text class="setting-title">显示补钙锚点提醒</text><text class="setting-copy">在计划中保留食物提醒</text></view><switch checked="{{settings.calciumAnchorReminder}}" color="#176B46" data-key="calciumAnchorReminder" bindchange="toggleSetting" /></view>
    <view class="setting-row"><view><text class="setting-title">显示维生素 D 提醒</text><text class="setting-copy">复诊时核对补充与检测</text></view><switch checked="{{settings.vitaminDReminder}}" color="#176B46" data-key="vitaminDReminder" bindchange="toggleSetting" /></view>
  </view>

  <text class="section-title">我的补充提醒</text>
  <view class="reminder-form surface">
    <textarea maxlength="80" value="{{newReminder}}" bindinput="inputReminder" placeholder="例如：复诊时带钙片瓶身" auto-height />
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="addReminder" hover-class="button-hover">添加提醒</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!reminders.length}}" class="surface status-panel"><text class="status-title">还没有个人提醒</text><text class="status-detail">这里适合记录复诊问题、补充剂标签或计划调整。</text></view>
  <view wx:else class="surface reminder-list">
    <view wx:for="{{reminders}}" wx:key="id" class="reminder-row">
      <view class="reminder-main {{item.done ? 'done' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleReminder"><view class="reminder-check">{{item.done ? '✓' : ''}}</view><text>{{item.text}}</text></view>
      <view class="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeReminder" aria-label="删除提醒">删除</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="warning"><text class="warning-title">需要联系医生的情况</text><text>持续骨痛、明显乏力或抽筋、反复头晕；疗程较长且从未评估维生素 D 或骨密度。不要自行叠加多种含钙、维生素 D 的产品。</text></view>
</view>
